    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859970/extras/af35b663e9b5f302eb1d84af358f1bfc.poster.avif?t=1754007757\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859970/extras/af35b663e9b5f302eb1d84af358f1bfc.webm?t=1754007757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859970/extras/af35b663e9b5f302eb1d84af358f1bfc.mp4?t=1754007757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infiltrate the remnants of a fallen empire in this dark sci-fi isometric action game where extraction meets base defense. Extract valuable loot, establish defenses against hostile fanatics, and unlock the gateway to a dimension of cosmic dread that defies comprehension.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>RAID A FALLEN EMPIRE</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every region of the empire has unique challenges, quests, and loot. Collect as much as you can and extract without dying to build your arsenal. No raid into a region is the same as the enemy adapts to each successful extraction you pull off. Countless combinations of weapons and abilities await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>DEFEND YOUR BASE</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hordes of pirates, a legion of traitors, and an armada of cultists want you dead.\u00a0Craft a variety of defensive structures to hold off waves of enemies. Race the clock between each attack to recover and raid the enemy back before they come again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>ENTER THE VEIL</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open a gateway into a corrupted realm that is spewing abominations into our dimension. Delve deep, defeat the terrors within, uncover its secrets, and end this apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859970/extras/47d2c305889cc25becff1b6b2197823d.poster.avif?t=1754007757\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859970/extras/47d2c305889cc25becff1b6b2197823d.webm?t=1754007757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859970/extras/47d2c305889cc25becff1b6b2197823d.mp4?t=1754007757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859970/extras/af35b663e9b5f302eb1d84af358f1bfc.poster.avif?t=1754007757\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859970/extras/af35b663e9b5f302eb1d84af358f1bfc.webm?t=1754007757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859970/extras/af35b663e9b5f302eb1d84af358f1bfc.mp4?t=1754007757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infiltrate the remnants of a fallen empire in this dark sci-fi isometric action game where extraction meets base defense. Extract valuable loot, establish defenses against hostile fanatics, and unlock the gateway to a dimension of cosmic dread that defies comprehension.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>RAID A FALLEN EMPIRE</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every region of the empire has unique challenges, quests, and loot. Collect as much as you can and extract without dying to build your arsenal. No raid into a region is the same as the enemy adapts to each successful extraction you pull off. Countless combinations of weapons and abilities await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>DEFEND YOUR BASE</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hordes of pirates, a legion of traitors, and an armada of cultists want you dead.\u00a0Craft a variety of defensive structures to hold off waves of enemies. Race the clock between each attack to recover and raid the enemy back before they come again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>ENTER THE VEIL</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open a gateway into a corrupted realm that is spewing abominations into our dimension. Delve deep, defeat the terrors within, uncover its secrets, and end this apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859970/extras/47d2c305889cc25becff1b6b2197823d.poster.avif?t=1754007757\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859970/extras/47d2c305889cc25becff1b6b2197823d.webm?t=1754007757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859970/extras/47d2c305889cc25becff1b6b2197823d.mp4?t=1754007757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
